# cargo-deb maintainer-script templates. The systemd parts of the scripts
# are generated from [package.metadata.deb.systemd-units] and inserted at
# #DEBHELPER#. postinst adds the notice that an upgrade did not restart
# gpudogd. copyright is not a script: it is installed as
# /usr/share/doc/gpudog/copyright and must carry LICENSE's text, indented.
# lintian-overrides is not read by cargo-deb here either: an asset installs
# it as /usr/share/lintian/overrides/gpudog. changelog is the Debian
# changelog: add an entry for every released version.
